      "description": {
        "fun": "Only Galarian Meowth become Perrserker: its hair has hardened into a horned Viking helmet with its coin set in front, and its claws can join into daggers. It lives for the thrill of battle, and many epic tales praise its valour. Less heroically, it leaves rubbish all over its home, and it and Persian can't stand each other.",
        "guide": "A Steel Pokémon introduced in Generation 8 that evolves only from Galarian Meowth. Its head hair has hardened into a horned, helmet-like shape, and its claws form daggers. It is fierce and loves to battle.",
        "tagline": "A Viking cat that lives to fight and never tidies up",
